# Liliana of the Veil's −6: "Separate all permanents target player controls into two piles. That player sacrifices all
# permanents in the pile of their choice." Liliana climbs to 6 with three +1s, then Bot1 puts Bot2's two creatures in
# the first pile, which leaves its two Forests as the second (CR 700.3: only the target's permanents are separated, and
# every one of them is in a pile). Bot2 chooses the first pile and sacrifices both creatures together; its lands stay,
# and Liliana, at 0 loyalty, goes to the graveyard (CR 704.5i).

